WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.795 --> 00:00:04.630
Hello?

00:00:05.047 --> 00:00:06.298
Jessica Jones...

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:09.343
you are a cheater.

00:00:13.055 --> 00:00:14.640
You were given
every advantage.

00:00:15.516 --> 00:00:17.184
Allowed to make mistake

00:00:17.267 --> 00:00:18.602
after mistake.

00:00:19.645 --> 00:00:21.438
You can't control yourself.

00:00:22.898 --> 00:00:24.608
You have no discipline,

00:00:25.359 --> 00:00:26.276
just brute force.

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:30.280
What do you want?

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:33.617
I want you to die.

00:00:36.328 --> 00:00:39.248
Gregory Salinger. He's smarter
than both of us combined.

00:00:39.665 --> 00:00:40.832
I don't know about that.

00:00:41.833 --> 00:00:43.001
I know who you are.

00:00:43.085 --> 00:00:44.169
It's not exactly a secret.

00:00:44.253 --> 00:00:45.796
So, you know
I can break your face?

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:50.050
-I barely survived him.
-Salinger did this.

00:00:50.133 --> 00:00:51.176
Let's go get him.

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:53.387
I don't need your help,
and you don't need mine.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.848
He was unjustly arrested.

00:00:57.683 --> 00:00:59.393
When you cozy up to maniacs,

00:00:59.476 --> 00:01:01.603
people around you get hurt.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:08.777
Everybody's got a story.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:11.238
A beginning, a middle,

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:13.156
an end.

00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.741
-I'm late for work.
-As what?

00:01:14.825 --> 00:01:16.368
Super cat burglar?

00:01:16.451 --> 00:01:18.537
You know what, Jess?
You do it your way.

00:01:19.288 --> 00:01:20.831
I'm gonna do it my way.

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:23.750
There's still a way this ends
with me respecting you.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:25.711
That's not my highest priority
right now.

00:01:26.753 --> 00:01:28.088
Jessica Jones...

00:01:28.839 --> 00:01:30.799
you believed
that you could save the world,

00:01:31.633 --> 00:01:34.469
but you're terrified
you've already failed them.

00:01:34.553 --> 00:01:35.679
And you have,

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:38.724
because you are not,
and you never will be,

00:01:39.391 --> 00:01:40.309
a hero.

00:01:53.238 --> 00:01:55.616
Are you still a hero
if nobody thinks you are?

00:01:56.450 --> 00:01:58.869
Like I give a shit
what other people think.

